{"id": "clm:20f80b22584513e8c3d44587c33226c0ee09c58c58bee9b84b20623b83b6ac0b", "type": "statement", "text": "When creating a DATE archive through the API or Terraform, include criteria.dateField (Terraform date_field) in the partition-field list. It consumes one of the three available slots. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-11-13)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/2024-11-13/operation/operation-getgroupclusteronlinearchive", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Partition Field Count Limits (DATE vs CUSTOM)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/online-archive/configure-online-archive-standard.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/master/docs/resources/online_archive.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e54d1a78017601c13716b14bbcb25974ff6bc1a3f1b256e8f1c9d5f63c21a8c6", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3145ff56a1245c12e6e462a73b27a4c8b5c713f9b2ecc02a5db8aca4a93f56ef", "ev:5ceeda52f9ac47bbf34de8a4500e73202308fac9ca5cd2d35344e4c461e537b6"]}
{"id": "clm:04c1229672265e0b6780597ebaeb1e4f9d933c31522635954112dd080a7ceeb5", "type": "statement", "text": "For criteria.type DATE, the documented maximum is three partition fields total, including the required archival date field; at most two other fields can be added. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-11-13)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/2024-11-13/operation/operation-getgroupclusteronlinearchive", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Partition Field Count Limits (DATE vs CUSTOM)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/online-archive/configure-online-archive-standard.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/master/docs/resources/online_archive.md", "https://www.pulumi.com/registry/packages/mongodbatlas%403.x/api-docs/onlinearchive/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e54d1a78017601c13716b14bbcb25974ff6bc1a3f1b256e8f1c9d5f63c21a8c6", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:5ceeda52f9ac47bbf34de8a4500e73202308fac9ca5cd2d35344e4c461e537b6"]}
{"id": "clm:76ef78f525955be83579e444fca734b83e3b4c136a96d37310e92fbad6fb539b", "type": "statement", "text": "For criteria.type CUSTOM, the documented maximum is two partition fields total. The DATE three-field allowance is conditional on DATE criteria, not a general allowance for every archive. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-11-13)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/2024-11-13/operation/operation-getgroupclusteronlinearchive", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Partition Field Count Limits (DATE vs CUSTOM)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/master/docs/resources/online_archive.md", "https://www.pulumi.com/registry/packages/mongodbatlas%403.x/api-docs/onlinearchive/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e54d1a78017601c13716b14bbcb25974ff6bc1a3f1b256e8f1c9d5f63c21a8c6", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:5ceeda52f9ac47bbf34de8a4500e73202308fac9ca5cd2d35344e4c461e537b6"]}
{"id": "clm:a1a9a60fe8bed52d64ff1f04095b1b56c087de88464d33eae609b92a7fcfb9c6", "type": "statement", "text": "An Online Archive must have at least one partition field; the documented maxima are not a requirement to populate every available field slot. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-11-13)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/2024-11-13/operation/operation-getgroupclusteronlinearchive", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Partition Field Count Limits (DATE vs CUSTOM)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/online-archive/configure-online-archive-standard.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e54d1a78017601c13716b14bbcb25974ff6bc1a3f1b256e8f1c9d5f63c21a8c6", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3eaba268c117aacb6383852440603e8980bf3d9e745b056fcb2dc491309fab06", "ev:5ceeda52f9ac47bbf34de8a4500e73202308fac9ca5cd2d35344e4c461e537b6"]}
